  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize capturing the Fives and Nines. A single trick containing a Nine and a Pedro is a massive 14ndpoint swing.\n\nIf your partner leads a suit, 'smear' your high-value 5s onto the trick if you think mereka will win it, to ensure the points are safe.\n\nDefensive Pitching: If you have a poor hand, pitch a suit where you have no scoring cards to minimize the points available to opponents.",
